  "body_text": "Characterize the microbial diversity of your samples\nMicrobial Community Analysis\n        LDgenX supports projects investigating bacterial, fungal and other microbial communities using high-throughput sequencing technologies to characterize their diversity, composition, and functional potential.\n            Approaches\n        16S Sequencing\nAnalysis of bacterial community diversity and composition.ITS SequencingCharacterization of fungal communities.Microbial MetabarcodingComprehensive assessment of microbial diversity using targeted genetic markers.MetagenomicsIn-depth taxonomic and functional analysis of microbial communities through untargeted sequencing\n            Services\n        123456\n            Case study\n        \n            Microbial Community Profiling on Microplastics\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
